{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Where Speed Meets Chaos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Get ready to experience slot racing like never before. <strong>Speed Rivals</strong> combines precision, strategy, and adrenaline in every twist and turn. Master impossible tracks, customize every inch of your ride, and prove who rules the leaderboards and tournaments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/f9be008d4b4310c107d0768c6959c60c.avif?t=1761900184\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras_big/f9be008d4b4310c107d0768c6959c60c.avif?t=1761900184 width=800 height=293 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/eb559cc475d536785a17656b8748b07f.avif?t=1761900184\" width=768 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the <strong>track editor</strong> to design legendary circuits exactly how you want them. Upload your creations, challenge the community to beat your times, or discover new tracks from other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/487eeccbb812c6dc2fb7990177f7427b.poster.avif?t=1761900184\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/487eeccbb812c6dc2fb7990177f7427b.webm?t=1761900184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/487eeccbb812c6dc2fb7990177f7427b.mp4?t=1761900184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/6b13e914f84c30bcd1db8d931b2bbc41.avif?t=1761900184\" width=768 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and unlock over <strong>100 unique cars</strong> \u2014 from timeless classics to futuristic beasts. Repaint, add decals, slap on logos \u2014 make it yours. More cars and updates will keep coming based on community feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/32c4d35c0b06f3b9a65cdd7754af60df.poster.avif?t=1761900184\" width=766 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/32c4d35c0b06f3b9a65cdd7754af60df.webm?t=1761900184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/32c4d35c0b06f3b9a65cdd7754af60df.mp4?t=1761900184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/4bc38f42ef4a8f13a70980bad41b1949.avif?t=1761900184\" width=768 height=140 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to pick up, tough to master. Hit the gas, stay on the rail, and avoid derailing at all costs. Every corner pushes your reflexes and tactics to the edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/8d10bf565f71a14c30ed18bc39f19b5d.poster.avif?t=1761900184\" width=766 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/8d10bf565f71a14c30ed18bc39f19b5d.webm?t=1761900184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/8d10bf565f71a14c30ed18bc39f19b5d.mp4?t=1761900184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/316a8ea1727f3a9a45f86457bca7a6ae.avif?t=1761900184\" width=768 height=140 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the championship ranks and prove your skills race after race. Unlock new cars, tracks, and customization options by tackling tougher and tougher challenges. Rise up the <strong>leaderboards</strong>, win tournaments, and complete achievements to unlock everything <strong>Speed Rivals</strong> has to offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/39129fdd940d2721d6283fe11e61a443.poster.avif?t=1761900184\" width=766 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/39129fdd940d2721d6283fe11e61a443.webm?t=1761900184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/39129fdd940d2721d6283fe11e61a443.mp4?t=1761900184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/fa24442e9a3059e5b0c9f4c0180d7083.avif?t=1761900184\" width=768 height=140 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice without pressure and master every corner at your own pace. No time limit, no rivals \u2014 just you and the track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/e642b397cb8c2511e2e93a404906d89c.poster.avif?t=1761900184\" width=766 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/e642b397cb8c2511e2e93a404906d89c.webm?t=1761900184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/e642b397cb8c2511e2e93a404906d89c.mp4?t=1761900184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/96a561cba2baf0d5eafd5aa23443bb62.avif?t=1761900184\" width=768 height=140 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite friends onto your track and show them who\u2019s boss. <strong>Speed Rivals</strong> offers local multiplayer for fast, intense, chaotic races right on one screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/e247045a20566fbc784979cb0c1699be.poster.avif?t=1761900184\" width=766 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/e247045a20566fbc784979cb0c1699be.webm?t=1761900184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/e247045a20566fbc784979cb0c1699be.mp4?t=1761900184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave your mark on every track. Master the rail, design impossible challenges, battle in tournaments, and take on your friends. With constant updates and an active community, <strong>Speed Rivals</strong> is waiting for you. Ready to hit the track?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/9221c2649572d7f15b61f8316433cb2c.avif?t=1761900184\" width=768 height=140 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3389390?t=1761900184","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/d13132ddacd3643b88332cdd9bbdcb284af66db4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761900184","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/9fa56e7b96a08f3892b56638744cbc382b4a3e6a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761900184","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/9fa56e7b96a08f3892b56638744cbc382b4a3e6a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761900184","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":51},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Commentary available","id":14},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3719310,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Where Speed Meets Chaos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Get ready to experience slot racing like never before. <strong>Speed Rivals</strong> combines precision, strategy, and adrenaline in every twist and turn. Master impossible tracks, customize every inch of your ride, and prove who rules the leaderboards and tournaments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/f9be008d4b4310c107d0768c6959c60c.avif?t=1761900184\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras_big/f9be008d4b4310c107d0768c6959c60c.avif?t=1761900184 width=800 height=293 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/eb559cc475d536785a17656b8748b07f.avif?t=1761900184\" width=768 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the <strong>track editor</strong> to design legendary circuits exactly how you want them. Upload your creations, challenge the community to beat your times, or discover new tracks from other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/487eeccbb812c6dc2fb7990177f7427b.poster.avif?t=1761900184\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/487eeccbb812c6dc2fb7990177f7427b.webm?t=1761900184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/487eeccbb812c6dc2fb7990177f7427b.mp4?t=1761900184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=